id: 34
hanzi: 确定
pinyin: què dìng
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Verb

meanings_summary:
  en: to determine; to confirm; to make sure; definite; certain; fixed
  es: determinar; confirmar; cerciorarse; fijar; seguro; cierto; definitivo

senses[2]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Verb | Standard | to ascertain, verify, or make certain of a situation or fact beyond doubt | cerciorarse, verificar o comprobar la veracidad de algo disipando toda duda | 确定具体时间 (confirm specific time)
  2 | Adjective | Standard | fixed, definite, clear, or settled without ambiguity | firme, inequívoco, seguro o fijado de antemano | 确定的答案 (a definite answer)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 随从们屏住呼吸走近草丛仔细察看，这才彻底确定被利箭射中的并非真虎，而是一块巨石。 | Suícóng men bǐngzhù hūxī zǒujìn cǎocóng zǐxì chákàn, zhè cái chèdǐ quèdìng bèi lìjiàn shèzhòng de bìng fēi zhēn hǔ, érshì yí kuài jùshí. | Holding their breath, retinue members approached the grass to inspect closely, and only then confirmed that what had been struck was no tiger, but a boulder. | Conteniendo el aliento, los guardias se acercaron a inspeccionar la maleza y solo entonces confirmaron que la presa atravesada no era un tigre, sino una mole de roca.
  #2 | 经过专家评审委员会的多轮严谨论证，项目方案的核心技术指标与实施周期最终得以确定。 | Jīngguò zhuānjiā píngshěn wěiyuánhuì de duō lún yánjǐn lùnzhèng, xiàngmù fāng'àn de héxīn jìshù zhǐbiāo yǔ shíshī zhōuqī zuìzhōng déyǐ quèdìng. | Following multiple rounds of rigorous appraisal by the expert panel, the project's core technical benchmarks and timeline were finally confirmed. | Tras sucesivas rondas de debate por parte de la comisión de expertos, quedaron al fin fijados los parámetros técnicos y el calendario de ejecución del proyecto.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  确定目标 | determine or set an objective
  确定时间 | confirm or fix a time
  十分确定 | completely certain; absolutely sure
  无法确定 | cannot determine; uncertain
  确定方案 | finalize or establish a plan
  确定无疑 | confirmed beyond any shadow of doubt

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  确凿无疑 | què záo wú yí | irrefutable and authentic beyond doubt
  坚定不移 | jiān dìng bù yí | unswerving and firm; resolute and steadfast
  盖棺论定 | gài guān lùn dìng | final verdict is rendered after death
  确有其事 | què yǒu qí shì | there is indeed such a matter; genuinely true

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  确 | què | authentic; solid; firm; certain | auténtico; sólido; certero; seguro | 石 | stone / rock | 石 (rock, solid hardness) | 寉 (hè, white crane / phonetic) | 12 | 左右结构 | Simplified from 確. Ancient pictogram of a hard stone 石 tested for authenticity, symbolizing unyielding certainty. | Striking a firm stone (石) with a tool confirms its authentic, solid, hard reality (确). | Golpear la piedra viva (石) con un cincel confirma su dureza sólida e inquebrantable certeza (确). | 51 | MRNBG | 確
  定 | dìng | settle; fix; calm; establish | fijar; asentar; aquietar; decidir | 宀 | roof / shelter | 宀 (roof, home security) | 疋 (zhèng, foot planted upright) | 8 | 上下结构 | Ancient pictogram showing a foot 疋 walking into a safe shelter 宀 and standing still, signifying settling firmly. | Resting one's feet securely inside the shelter of a house (宀) settles everything into fixed calm (定). | Asentar las plantas de los pies bajo el cobijo de un hogar (宀) aquieta el ánimo y fija el reposo (定). | 51 | JMHO | 

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Hard and solid as a rock (确) rested peacefully beneath a sheltered home (定) establishes unswerving certainty (确定).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Firme como la roca (确) asentada en el reposo del hogar (定), lo certero queda fijado para siempre (确定).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: In ancient Chinese epistemological texts (墨经), 确 represents empirical hardness that can be struck without crumbling, while 定 represents spatial repose and social stability. Combining both constructs the concept of definitive confirmation that withstands doubt.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Dual falling 4th tones: 'què dìng' (51-51). Articulate both syllables with crisp, unwavering downward pitch momentum.

