semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 确定 denotes verifying facts to remove ambiguity, or finalizing agreements and arrangements.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 确定 vs. 确认 | quèrèn | 确定 emphasizes finalizing, deciding, or settling a plan/date into a fixed state (确定行程), whereas 确认 emphasizes formally acknowledging or verifying that information already presented is accurate (确认密码).
    2 | 确定 vs. 决定 | juédìng | 确定 focuses on clarity and certainty of truth or schedule, whereas 决定 focuses on making a volitional choice between alternatives.
    3 | 确定 vs. 肯定 | kěndìng | 确定 can be a transitive verb taking clauses, while 肯定 often functions as an affirmative adverb meaning 'definitely / surely' (他肯定会来) or adjective for positive feedback.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 穿行在浩渺的人生旅途中，我们常常为未来的不确定性感到迷茫与焦虑。然而，真正的成熟并不在于能确定每一个阶段的答案，而在于接纳未知，并在每一次勇敢的尝试中明确内心的热爱与追求。 | Chuānxíng zài hàomiǎo de rénshēng lǚtú zhōng, wǒmen chángcháng wèi wèilái de búquèdìngxìng gǎndào mímáng yǔ jiāolǜ. Rán'ér, zhēnzhèng de chéngshú bìng bùzàiyú néng quèdìng měi yí gè jiēduàn de dá'àn, ér zàiyú jiēnà wèizhī, bìng zài měi yí cì yǒnggǎn de chángshì zhōng míngquè nèixīn de rè'ài yǔ zhuīqiú. | Traveling on the vast journey of life, we often feel bewildered by future uncertainties. Yet true maturity lies not in confirming every answer in advance, but in embracing the unknown and clarifying inner devotions through brave attempts. | En la vasta andadura de la existencia, la incertidumbre ante el porvenir engendra a menudo zozobra. No obstante, la madurez no estriba en predecir cada respuesta, sino en acoger lo ignoto y clarificar con arrojo las nobles devociones del corazón.
  #2 | 在重大基础设施工程立项前，地质勘察团队必须进行多点位深层钻探取样，以确定地基岩土层的力学承载极限。唯有在前期勘测中拿到确凿数据，才能确保百年工程在施工与运营过程中的绝对安全。 | Zài zhòngdà jīchǔ shèshī gōngchéng lìxiàng qián, dìzhì kānchá tuánduì bìxū jìnxíng duō-diǎnwèi shēncéng zuàntàn qǔyàng, yǐ quèdìng dìjī yántǔcéng de lìxué chéngzài jíxiàn. Wéiyǒu zài qiánqī kāncè zhōng nádào quèzáo shùjù, cáinéng quèbǎo bǎinián gōngchéng zài shīgōng yǔ yùnyíng guòchéng zhōng de juéduì ānquán. | Prior to approving infrastructure projects, geological teams must drill deep core samples at multiple sites to confirm the bedrock's mechanical bearing threshold. Securing irrefutable preliminary data guarantees absolute engineering safety. | Antes de iniciar magnas obras de infraestructura, los geólogos deben perforar estratos profundos para determinar el límite de resistencia mecánica del terreno. Solo recabando datos concluyentes se garantiza la seguridad de obras llamadas a perdurar siglos.
